Package: mcp-keeper
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Arvind <arvindkumarsjpr@gmail.com>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, python3-tomlkit
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: see and heal the MCP servers of every AI client from the top bar
 A small stand-in sits between each MCP client (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor,
 Claude Desktop, Windsurf, Antigravity, Gemini CLI, VS Code) and its local
 servers. When a server crashes or cannot start, the client stays connected and
 the server is brought back; a top-bar indicator shows every server's health
 with a green/total meter, live logs, one-click restart and config backups.
